# Shell entry points are executed by bash: the git hooks (.githooks/*) and the
# CI scripts. This repository checks out with core.autocrlf=true, which would
# hand those files CRLF and make bash fail on the shebang line with
# `$'\r': command not found` - the failure mode where the pre-commit gate
# silently stops being a gate. Attributes outrank autocrlf, so these stay LF
# on every checkout, on every platform.
.githooks/* text eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf

# Media and fonts are bytes, not text: never line-ending mangled in either
# direction, whatever core.autocrlf is set to.
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
